From 0e2136e97dc17e7a7f49cd13301e4cfda4dfe646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ry <ry@Rys-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:20:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] RomCore embedding layer: hidden Dusklight UI, SDL virtual
 gamepad, host pause, unique native lib

- src/dusk/romcore_embed.{hpp,cpp}: DUSK_ROMCORE_EMBED gate, JNI bridge (virtual gamepad, host pause),
  first-visible-frame / notice / fatal events to the host Activity
- Dusklight UI (overlay, touch controls, menu bar, console, prelaunch, preset, crash-report consent,
  ImGui menus, toasts, UI input) is never created/shown in embedded mode; no sentry/crash handler
- fatal errors become a host error panel instead of abort(); Info log level
- DuskActivity loads libdusklight_main.so normally; drops the RomRunner side-load; exposes host natives/events
- gradle: NDK 29 pinned, optional mod packages not bundled

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
